- Add package selection and order creation.
- Display the VietQR image, exact amount, account details, expiry time, and copyable transfer message.
- Add the “Tôi đã chuyển khoản” confirmation button.
- Add a cancellation action only for PENDING_TRANSFER.
- Warn users to confirm only after the transfer completes.
- Show AWAITING_REVIEW with an explanation that an admin will verify the bank transfer manually.
- Show retry guidance when Telegram notification delivery fails.
- After 90 seconds, switch to passive waiting copy.
- Do not promise push notifications.
- Show SUCCESS and the refreshed balance.
- Show CANCELLED with a new-order action.
- Show EXPIRED with a new-order action.
- Follow .agent/design-system/nhuthungfoto/MASTER.md for typography, colors, spacing, focus behavior, responsive layout, accessibility, and 150–300 ms transitions.

Testing - Add backend tests:- Test valid and invalid package IDs.
