Verify - Final verification:
- Apply all migrations to local Supabase.
- Regenerate database types.
- Run backend lint, typecheck, and tests.
- Run frontend lint, typecheck, build, and tests.
- Create an order locally and verify its expiry timestamp.
- Confirm the transfer and verify Telegram receives the review message.
- Check the banking app manually.
- Approve through Telegram.
- Verify the order becomes SUCCESS, exactly one payment row appears, exactly one credit-history row appears, and the balance increases once.
- Click approve repeatedly and verify no additional credits are granted.
- Test customer cancellation before confirmation.
- Test that cancellation is blocked after confirmation.
- Test the rejection path.
- Test stale-order expiration and active-order replacement.
- Deploy to staging and complete one small real VietQR transfer before production release.
